					"zoneLimit": 1,
					"mapLimit": 1
				},
				"sounds": {
					"ambient": [
						"LOOPMAGI"
					],
					"visit": [
						"MYSTERY"
					]
				},
				"description": "{H4 Memorial Intermediate Exchange}\n\nAn exchange in memory of H4: swaps H4 creatures with the upgraded creatures of the same faction and level (levels 4-5) (Life with Castle, Order with Tower, Nature with Rampart, Death with Necropolis, Chaos with Dungeon, Might with Stronghold; H4 creatures have no upgrades, so they pair with the original upgrades, and also with upgrades of the same line from the Tides of War and Third Upgrades mods). H4 neutral creatures swap with original neutral creatures of the same level. Shrunk and Downgraded troops (levels 4-5) can be restored to their original form here. Free, with unlimited visits; you pay the difference only when exchanging neutrals into a more expensive creature, or into the more expensive Tides of War or Third Upgrades forms, in batches by count. Only one creature type is exchanged at a time; to exchange another, press Space to visit again.",
				"visitMode": "unlimited",
				"selectMode": "selectPlayer",
				"canRefuse": true,
				"onSelectMessage": "{H4 Memorial Intermediate Exchange}\n\nPick an icon: each icon shows the creature you will get, and all matching troops in your army will be exchanged into it. Only one creature type is exchanged at a time; to exchange another, press Space to visit again. You can exchange H4 creatures with the original upgraded creatures of the same faction at levels 4-5, neutral creatures of the same level with one another, and restore Shrunk and Downgraded troops. Free, with unlimited visits; exchanging into a more expensive creature costs the difference per creature.",
				"onEmptyMessage": "{H4 Memorial Intermediate Exchange}\n\nYou have no troops that can be exchanged here: this place only swaps H4 creatures with original upgraded creatures of the same faction at levels 4-5, neutral creatures of the same level, and restores Shrunk and Downgraded troops (levels 4-5).",
