				"description": "{H4 Memorial Advanced Exchange}\n\nAn exchange in memory of H4: swaps H4 creatures with the upgraded creatures of the same faction and level (levels 6-7) (Life with Castle, Order with Tower, Nature with Rampart, Death with Necropolis, Chaos with Dungeon, Might with Stronghold; H4 creatures have no upgrades, so they pair with the original upgrades, and also with upgrades of the same line from the Tides of War and Third Upgrades mods). At level 7, both H4 creatures of a faction and the original level 7 upgrade can be swapped with one another. H4 neutral creatures swap with original neutral creatures of the same level. Shrunk and Downgraded troops (level 6 and above) can be restored to their original form here. Free, with unlimited visits; you pay the difference only when exchanging neutrals into a more expensive creature, or into the more expensive Tides of War or Third Upgrades forms, in batches by count. Only one creature type is exchanged at a time; to exchange another, press Space to visit again.",
				"visitMode": "unlimited",
				"selectMode": "selectPlayer",
				"canRefuse": true,
